  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/IMG_5873.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Teatre d&#39;improvisaci&oacute; amb Kancaneo al Raval de Sant Josep, divendres 29 de vesprada (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lLdupxTTwNw\" target=\"_blank\">punxeu per a veure el v&iacute;deo</a>), i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/IMG_6103.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>el contancontes Vecinos/Vecinas a c&agrave;rrec de ElombligoyLapelusa, dissabte 30 de mat&iacute; a la Font de Dins (<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v6_AnAHSPjs\" target=\"_blank\">punxeu per a a veure el v&iacute;deo</a>).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaldiversitatlgtbi18/img_5855.jpg\" alt=\"img_5855\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaldiversitatlgtbi18/img_5857.jpg\" alt=\"img_5857\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaldiversitatlgtbi18/img_5859.jpg\" alt=\"img_5859\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaldiversitatlgtbi18/img_5860.jpg\" alt=\"img_5860\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaldiversitatlgtbi18/img_5861.jpg\" alt=\"img_5861\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaldiversitatlgtbi18/img_5862.jpg\" alt=\"img_5862\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finaldiversitatlgtbi18/img_5863.jpg\" alt=\"img_5863\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a